      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1937889814814072921",
      "text": "[4:01PM] #EbuteEro #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\n Traffic descending from CMS bridge towards Offin canal is currently moving slowly due to market activities and a high volume of vehicles. However, immediately after the Offin canal area, the traffic flow towards Eko bridge by Nepa is good.\n\nConversely, movement on Eko bridge by Nepa heading towards CMS bridge is proceeding smoothly. Furthermore, traffic descending Eko bridge in the direction of Elegbeta Mini stadium and the Ebute-Ero market is also flowing well at this time. \n\nSimilarly, vehicles descending from Carter bridge towards the Ebute-Ero market, continuing along Leventis through the UBA roundabout to connect both inner and outer Marina, are experiencing good traffic conditions.\n\nThe Broad street stretch leading to Apongbon underneath the bridge and connecting to the Offin Canal market is experiencing slow movement. Currently, there are no reported impediments to traffic, and personnel are on ground to manage the flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
